{
  "slug": "voip-ms-unofficial",
  "name": "VoIP.ms (Unofficial)",
  "url": "https://voipms-mcp.ecliptical.io/mcp",
  "description": "Connect your VoIP.ms account to Claude and manage your cloud telephony in plain language. This connector exposes the VoIP.ms API as scoped tools, so Claude can work with your phone numbers (DIDs), send and read SMS and MMS, check voicemail with transcriptions, configure call routing and forwarding, review call records, and look up account balance and billing.\n\nAccess is granted per resource. When you connect, you approve exactly which areas Claude may touch -- and most areas offer a read-only option, so you can let Claude look without letting it change anything. Nothing is granted that you did not approve, and you can review the full scope catalog before connecting.\n\nYou bring your own VoIP.ms account: after connecting, you supply your VoIP.ms API credentials once, and they are encrypted at rest. The connector acts only on your account, on your behalf.\n\nThis is an independent, unofficial connector for VoIP.ms; it is not built or endorsed by VoIP.ms.",
